(g) Causes, provokes or engages in any fight, brawl, or riotous conduct so as to endanger the life, limb, health or property of another or of public property;
(h) Assembles or congregates with another/others and causes, provokes/engages in fight/brawl;
(j) Assembles or congregates with another and engages/attempts to engage in gaming;
(k) Frequents any public place or assembles to obtain any valuable thing/money from another by an illegal and fraudulent scheme, trick, artifice, or device, or attempts to do so;
(l) Frequents any place or vehicle where gaming or the illegal sale or possession of alcoholic beverages or narcotics or dangerous drugs is practiced, allowed or tolerated;
(m) Uses "fighting words" directed towards any person, causing said person to become outraged and thus creating turmoil;
(n) Assembles or congregates with another or others and does bodily harm to another or the property of another or public property;
(o) By acts of violence or threats thereof, interferes with another's pursuit of a lawful occupation;
